Art
---

This repository holds only free art. `bun run check:restricted-art` (tools/restricted-art.ts) fails on a rights
record of a restricted licence. The samples under samples/ use free art (CC0 or CC BY). Each sample lists its
sources in its rights records. samples/gltf-samples holds models of the Khronos
glTF-Sample-Assets under CC0 1.0 and CC BY 4.0. samples/gltf-samples/rights/khronos-cc-by.yaml has the attribution
text of the CC BY models. The showroom template of the CLI (packages/cli/templates/showroom) holds the documents of
samples/showroom with its CC0 rights record. `scenity create --template showroom` downloads the CC0 source files from
Poly Haven.
